1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Welcome to this short introduction to the platform.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:10,200
In the next few minutes we will sign in, open a workspace and look at the data explorer.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:16,800
After signing in with your institutional login, the dashboard lists your workspaces.

4
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:23,100
Every workspace needs a billing project, which pays for compute and storage.

5
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:29,400
From the data explorer you can filter files by study and export a manifest to your workspace.
